    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Randall Putz is the mayor of Big Bear Lake and a small business owner. He has served on the Big Bear Lake City Council for 12 years and was a Bear Valley Unified School Board trustee for six years. He co-founded the Big Bear Valley Trails Foundation and opened Chirp Nature Center in 2018. Putz supports reducing red tape and expanding funding for workforce and affordable housing. His campaign says he supports policing strategies that target violent crime and drug trafficking, and investments in fire protection and rural emergency medical services. He has called for tying education spending to teacher retention and student outcomes, rather than paperwork compliance.",
